{"id": "16-251-2-8", "zh": "我们来说远过去时（parokkhā）的形式：vaca，vacu。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-251-9-12", "zh": "vace，vacittha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-251-13-16", "zh": "vacaṃ，vacimha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-251-17-20", "zh": "vacittha，vacire。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-251-21-24", "zh": "vacittho，vacivho。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-251-25-28", "zh": "vaciṃ，vacimhe。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-252-2-8", "zh": "我们来说昨日过去时（hiyyattanī）的形式：avacā，avacū。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-252-9-12", "zh": "avaco，avacuttha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-252-13-16", "zh": "avocaṃ，avacumha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-252-17-20", "zh": "avacuttha，avacutthuṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-252-21-24", "zh": "avacase，avacuvhaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-252-25-28", "zh": "avaciṃ，avacamhase。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-253-2-10", "zh": "我们来说今日过去时（ajjatanī）的形式：avaci，avocuṃ，avaciṃsu。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-253-11-14", "zh": "avoco，avocuttha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-253-15-18", "zh": "avociṃ，avocumha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-253-19-22", "zh": "avocā，avocu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-253-23-26", "zh": "avacase，avocivaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-253-27-30", "zh": "avocaṃ，avocimhe。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-254-2-8", "zh": "我们来说未来时（bhavissantī）的形式：vakkhati，vakkhanti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-254-9-12", "zh": "vakkhasi，vakkhatha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-254-13-16", "zh": "vakkhāmi，vakkhāma。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-254-17-20", "zh": "vakkhate，vakkhante。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-254-21-24", "zh": "vakkhase，vakkhavhe。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-254-25-27", "zh": "vakkhassaṃ，vakkhamhe。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-255-2-15", "zh": "这些词的意义，应当用“kathessati（他将说），kathessanti（他们将说）”等来解释。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-255-16-26", "zh": "至于义为“**rose**”（发怒）的 vakkha 词根，则先说“vakkhati，vakkhanti，", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "16-255-27-41", "zh": "vakkhasi”等等，最后在第一人称单数的位置上应当说“vakkhemi”。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-255-42-53", "zh": "而这些词的意义，应当用“rosati（他发怒），rosanti（他们发怒）”等来解释。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-255-54-59", "zh": "这是 vaca 与 vakkha 两个词根依未来时与现在时来对照词形的方法。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-255-60-71", "zh": "vaca 词根还有另一些附加了未来时语尾的形式：vakkhissati，vakkhissanti。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-255-72-75", "zh": "vakkhissasi，vakkhissatha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-255-76-79", "zh": "vakkhissāmi，vakkhissāma。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-255-80-83", "zh": "vakkhissate，vakkhissante。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-255-84-87", "zh": "vakkhissase，vakkhissavhe。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-255-88-91", "zh": "vakkhissaṃ，vakkhissāmhe。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-256-2-4", "zh": "关于这一点，有如下圣典文句：", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-257-2-9", "zh": "“除去过去诸劫、种种生存中的行持，", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "16-258-2-12", "zh": "我要讲述这一劫中的行持，请听我说。”", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-259-2-27", "zh": "在《Gadrata 问》里也能看到“国王会和你们寒暄，然后说：‘居士，请认准合适的座位坐下吧。’”这类义注文句，正因如此，才编排出这样的词形系列。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "16-259-28-43", "zh": "义为“**rose**”（发怒）的 vakkha 词根，也有附加了未来时语尾的形式：“vakkhissati，vakkhissanti”等。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-259-44-55", "zh": "而这些词的意义，应当用“rosissati（他将发怒），rosissanti（他们将发怒）”等来解释。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-259-56-61", "zh": "这是 vaca 与 vakkha 两个词根仅依未来时来对照词形的方法。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-260-2-9", "zh": "avacissā，vacissā，avacissaṃsu，vacissaṃsu。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-260-10-13", "zh": "其余的都可以依此类推。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-260-14-26", "zh": "这里本应说明 vutta 一词的各种意义，但我们暂且不说，留到后面再讲，因为后面那里比这里更适合说明。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "16-261-2-4", "zh": "cu，义为死没（cavana）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-261-5-6", "zh": "cavati（他死没）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-261-7-15", "zh": "使役形是“cāveti”。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-261-16-18", "zh": "从天众中死没（devakāyā cuto）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-261-19-21", "zh": "凋落的莲花（cutaṃ padumaṃ）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-261-22-25", "zh": "cavituṃ，cavitvā。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-262-2-4", "zh": "loca，义为看见。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-262-5-6", "zh": "locati（他看）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-262-7-8", "zh": "locanaṃ（看）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-263-2-4", "zh": "seca，义为浇洒。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-263-5-6", "zh": "secati（他浇洒）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-264-2-5", "zh": "saca，义为清晰的言语。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-264-6-7", "zh": "sacati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-265-2-4", "zh": "kaca，义为束缚。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-265-5-6", "zh": "kacati（他束缚）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-266-2-5", "zh": "maca、muci，义为涂抹（kakkana）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-266-6-9", "zh": "kakkana 就是在身体上擦洗涂抹（ubbaṭṭana）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-266-10-11", "zh": "macati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-266-12-13", "zh": "muñcati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-266-14-16", "zh": "maci，义为执持、擦拭、供养。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "16-266-17-22", "zh": "执持、擦拭（ucchāya）、供养，共有三种意义。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "16-266-23-26", "zh": "其中，ucchāya 指的是除去污垢。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-266-27-28", "zh": "mañcati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-266-29-32", "zh": "mañco（床），mañcanaṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-266-33-37", "zh": "因为它承托着人，所以称为 mañca（床）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-267-2-4", "zh": "paca，义为使显明。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "16-267-5-6", "zh": "pacati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-267-7-15", "zh": "pāko，paripāko，vipāko，pakkaṃ phalaṃ（成熟的果实）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-268-2-4", "zh": "thuca，义为明净喜悦。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "16-268-5-6", "zh": "thocati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-269-2-5", "zh": "vaca、vaci，义为照耀。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-269-6-7", "zh": "vacati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-269-8-9", "zh": "vañcati。", "confidence": 90}
